# Let Sleeping Dogs Lie (windurst 46): Paku-Nakku, Pechiru-Mashiru and the school (Windurst Waters), Maabu-Sonbu (Port
# Windurst). A level-5 WAR (Making the Grade needs level 10: never available here), Windurst fame 225 (level 4),
# Teacher's Pet completed by GM (available, Moreno-Toeno's 437 Progress would cover this quest's 491; completed, its 439
# Event takes turns with 491 and with his script's 441 / 469). NPCs with a script (Moreno-Toeno: a random 441 / 469;
# Mashuu-Ajuu: Reap What You Sow's random 463 or nothing; Fuepepe, Pechiru-Mashiru: nothing here) take turns with an
# Event reply (the lookup's alternation, group 5's tables): the flow talks to Mashuu-Ajuu twice and to Moreno-Toeno three times
# (this quest's 491, his script, Teacher's Pet's 439); a zone change resets the turns.
# Available: Blazing Peppers traded to Paku-Nakku (no trade handler in section 1: nothing); the children's lines; 481,
# begun. Prog 0: Paku-Nakku 482, Pechiru-Mashiru 490, the children (<= 3), Fuepepe 493, Moreno-Toeno 491; the peppers
# at Prog 0: nil. Maabu-Sonbu 319 (Prog 1), 320. Prog 1: Pechiru-Mashiru 492; a bone chip: nil; the peppers with a
# Remedy (tradeHas, peppers first): Option 1, 494 (0, 1): Prog 2, the peppers taken, the Remedy kept. Prog 2: Paku-Nakku
# 482, Maabu-Sonbu 321 (0, peppers); Pechiru-Mashiru 495 (..., 1): Prog 3; 496; Paku-Nakku 499 option 1 (nothing),
# option 2 (Spoilsport, Prog 4). Prog 4: the children's 501-507, Fuepepe and Moreno-Toeno nil, Paku-Nakku 500,
# Maabu-Sonbu nil (227); Pechiru-Mashiru 497 with a full bag (nothing, Prog 4), 497: completed (fame 40, the Hypno
# Staff). Completed: no section; Paku-Nakku 431, Akkeke 427.
